{"id":8879779283143,"title":"Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 04","handle":"pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-04","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your bedroom into a cozy and stylish retreat with this Jeminise Comforter Set. Crafted for exceptional softness and breathability, this set promises a peaceful night's sleep while adding a touch of Halloween charm to your decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Filled with finely brushed microfibers for outstanding softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This 5-piece set includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExquisite Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features stylish and exquisite patterns that bring a fashionable and cozy aesthetic to your sleeping space.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Stitching:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comforter boasts exquisite stitching to enhance durability and prevent filling from shifting or clumping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Fit Fitted Sheet:\u003c\/strong\u003e The deep-pocket fitted sheet includes an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSelected Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a 'Ghost 1' design with pumpkin, ghost, and bat patterns, perfect for a Halloween theme.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eComforter Set\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBrushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling.\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eColor\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eGhost 1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eContemporary\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHorror Cartoon\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePumpkin,Ghost,Bats\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSelected Design\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eGhost 1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 x Comforter \u0026amp; 1 x Pillowcase \u0026amp; 1 x Pillow Sham \u0026amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet \u0026amp; 1 x Flat Sheet\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwin\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSelected Size\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwin\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eDimensions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e90 x 68 x 1 inches\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecial Feature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDeep-pocket fitted sheet fits up to 14 inch mattresses.\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth